00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:49.650
&GT;&GT; GOOD MORNING.

00:07:06.839 --> 00:07:07.020
MR..

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:10.470
MR..

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:11.310
MR..

