01:38:34.640 --> 01:38:39.830
NCPA HAS A PROPOSAL TO IMPROVE
THE EFFICIENCY

01:38:39.830 --> 01:38:42.410
OF THAT OPERATION BY 25%.

01:38:42.620 --> 01:38:46.189
THE ENERGY COMMISSION HAS SEEN
THE VALUE OF THAT,

01:38:46.189 --> 01:38:49.220
AND SO THEY HAVE CONTRIBUTED
$7 MILLION

01:38:49.220 --> 01:38:51.710
TO THE COST OF THAT IMPROVEMENT.

01:38:51.740 --> 01:38:54.920
THE DEPARTMENT OF WATER
RESOURCES HAS SENT SIGNALS

01:38:54.920 --> 01:38:57.680
THAT THEY ARE NOT GOING TO
PARTICIPATE IN,

01:38:57.800 --> 01:39:01.160
IN FUNDING AND EXPANDING THAT
FACILITIES

01:39:01.160 --> 01:39:02.930
RESOURCE THEY UTILIZE.

01:39:02.960 --> 01:39:04.610
THEY ARE, AS I UNDERSTAND IT,

01:39:04.820 --> 01:39:08.450
THAT THEY USE THE PASSAGE OF
SENATE BILL

01:39:08.450 --> 01:39:10.880
1020 A COUPLE OF YEARS AGO AS

01:39:10.880 --> 01:39:12.590
THE RATIONALE FOR HOW THEY WHY
THEY

01:39:12.590 --> 01:39:16.340
CANNOT PARTICIPATE IN THIS
EXTRAORDINARILY

01:39:16.340 --> 01:39:18.380
IMPORTANT EXPANSION OF

01:39:18.380 --> 01:39:21.800
AN EXISTING ASSET TO INCREASE
THE EFFICIENCY

01:39:21.800 --> 01:39:23.930
OF THAT FACILITY BY 25%.

01:39:24.320 --> 01:39:26.210
I DON'T UNDERSTAND THE REASON
WHY,

01:39:26.210 --> 01:39:28.280
AND I WOULD LIKE THE COMMITTEE
TO PURSUE THAT.

01:39:28.280 --> 01:39:29.420
THANK YOU VERY MUCH.

01:39:29.750 --> 01:39:30.740
THANK YOU.

