I WANT TO RETURN TO THE PENDING
CENTRAL

01:39:47.400 --> 01:39:49.680
PROCUREMENT PROPOSAL AT THE PUC.

01:39:49.680 --> 01:39:52.410
ONE OF THE THINGS THAT'S MISSING
FROM THAT

01:39:52.410 --> 01:39:55.080
PROPOSAL THAT WAS ORIGINALLY
INTENDED BY

01:39:55.080 --> 01:39:58.520
THE LEGISLATURE WITH THE PASSAGE
OF AB 1373,

01:39:58.520 --> 01:40:01.700
IS IMPERIAL VALLEY GEOTHERMAL
BEING PROCURED,

01:40:01.700 --> 01:40:05.060
EVEN THOUGH THE MID-TERM
RELIABILITY PROCUREMENT

01:40:05.060 --> 01:40:08.330
DIRECTED THE UTILITIES TO BUY
GEOTHERMAL,

01:40:08.540 --> 01:40:10.250
THE LOAD SERVING ENTITIES
HAVEN'T

01:40:10.250 --> 01:40:11.810
SIGNED POWER PURCHASE
AGREEMENTS.

01:40:11.810 --> 01:40:13.939
SO THE GEOTHERMAL WE'RE TRYING
TO DEVELOP

01:40:13.939 --> 01:40:16.520
DOWN IN IMPERIAL FOR THE ABILITY

01:40:16.520 --> 01:40:19.220
ALSO TO DEVELOP THE LITHIUM
INDUSTRY

01:40:19.870 --> 01:40:21.160
IS GOING TO BE DELAYED.

01:40:21.160 --> 01:40:23.170
SO WE REALLY HOPE THE COMMISSION

01:40:23.170 --> 01:40:24.340
WILL TAKE A CLOSER

01:40:24.340 --> 01:40:27.340
LOOK AT THE VALUE OF THE
CONVENTIONAL GEOTHERMAL,

01:40:27.340 --> 01:40:30.070
AND INCLUDE THAT IN THE
PROCUREMENT BY DWR.

01:40:30.100 --> 01:40:30.729
THANK YOU.

01:40:30.760 --> 01:40:31.720
THANK YOU.

