UM, I TOO WANT TO THANK OUR
PANELISTS.

01:40:44.710 --> 01:40:47.200
UH, YOU'VE DONE A YEOMAN'S JOB
WITH

01:40:47.200 --> 01:40:48.729
WHAT YOU HAVE TO WORK WITH,

01:40:48.729 --> 01:40:50.620
AND I'M JUST GOING TO BE HONEST.

01:40:50.620 --> 01:40:52.270
YOU'RE DOING IT WITH YOUR ARMS

01:40:52.270 --> 01:40:53.380
TIED BEHIND YOUR BACK.

01:40:53.500 --> 01:40:56.740
AND MUCH OF THE REASON WHY IT'S
BECAUSE

01:40:56.740 --> 01:40:58.450
OF SOME OF THE ASPIRATIONAL

01:40:58.450 --> 01:41:01.840
POLICIES THAT WE HAVE PASSED AS
A LEGISLATURE.

01:41:01.930 --> 01:41:03.910
AND I'M JUST GOING TO BE REAL
ABOUT THAT.

01:41:03.910 --> 01:41:05.920
AS SOMEONE WHO IS IN MY 14TH

01:41:05.920 --> 01:41:07.300
YEAR IN THE LEGISLATURE AND

01:41:07.300 --> 01:41:09.400
IF HAVE CHAIRED ENERGY ON BOTH

01:41:09.400 --> 01:41:11.380
THE ASSEMBLY AND THE ASSEMBLY,

01:41:11.920 --> 01:41:16.420
UM, I HAVE NO DOUBT THAT MUCH
OF WHAT

01:41:16.420 --> 01:41:18.729
WE PASSED HAS GOOD INTENTIONS.

01:41:19.150 --> 01:41:21.040
BUT AS THE OLD FOLKS USED TO
TELL ME,

01:41:21.040 --> 01:41:22.540
THE ROAD TO HELL IS PAVED EN

01:41:22.540 --> 01:41:24.189
PAVED WITH GOOD INTENTIONS,

01:41:24.189 --> 01:41:26.439
AND WE FIND OURSELVES HERE TODAY

01:41:26.439 --> 01:41:28.240
WITH THESE CHALLENGES BECAUSE

01:41:28.240 --> 01:41:30.520
OUR LEGISLATION HAS BEEN MORE

01:41:30.520 --> 01:41:32.470
ASPIRATIONAL THAN PRACTICAL.

01:41:32.470 --> 01:41:36.670
AND I WOULD WHEN I LOOK AT THE
TITLE OF THIS HEARING

01:41:37.060 --> 01:41:41.620
OF ELECTRIC RELIABILITY TOWARD
ZERO EMISSIONS,

01:41:41.620 --> 01:41:43.570
WE'RE FOCUSING ON INTERMITTENT

01:41:43.570 --> 01:41:46.270
INTERMITTENT RESOURCES INSTEAD

01:41:46.270 --> 01:41:52.090
OF DISPATCHABLE RESOURCES,
BASELOAD RESOURCES.

01:41:52.090 --> 01:41:54.250
AND WHEN WE TALK ABOUT ZERO
EMISSION,

01:41:54.250 --> 01:41:56.710
WE'RE FOCUSING ON NOT THE TWO
CLEANEST

01:41:56.710 --> 01:41:59.500
SOURCES OF ZERO EMISSION ENERGY.

01:41:59.500 --> 01:42:01.720
AND THAT'S NUCLEAR AND HYDRO.

01:42:01.750 --> 01:42:03.670
SO AT SOME POINT, WE NEED TO
START

01:42:03.670 --> 01:42:05.650
HAVING REAL ADULT CONVERSATIONS

01:42:05.650 --> 01:42:08.710
ABOUT WHAT OUR GOALS AND
OBJECTIVES ARE.

01:42:08.740 --> 01:42:10.420
IF IT'S ABOUT ZERO EMISSIONS,

01:42:10.420 --> 01:42:12.580
THEN WE NEED TO TALK ABOUT THE
CLEANEST SOURCE.

01:42:12.580 --> 01:42:15.430
YOU TALK TO ANY ELECTRICAL
ENGINEER

01:42:15.970 --> 01:42:17.500
IN THE WORLD AND THEY'LL TELL
YOU,

01:42:17.500 --> 01:42:19.930
AS YOU GUYS WILL ATTEST TO,

01:42:20.360 --> 01:42:23.960
HYDRO AND NUCLEAR ARE THE
CLEANEST SOURCES WE HAVE.

01:42:24.170 --> 01:42:26.570
SO AND WE TALK ABOUT
RELIABILITY,

01:42:26.570 --> 01:42:29.990
BASELOAD, DISPATCHABLE
RESOURCES.

01:42:29.990 --> 01:42:32.630
IT'S WHERE WE HAVE REAL
RELIABILITY,

01:42:32.630 --> 01:42:35.120
NOT ON BATTERIES, WIND AND
SOLAR.

01:42:35.120 --> 01:42:36.830
AND WE NEED TO EXPAND UPON THAT.

01:42:36.830 --> 01:42:38.630
AND WE NEED TO HAVE THOSE
CONVERSATIONS.

01:42:38.630 --> 01:42:43.400
AND THAT'S WHERE I THINK WE LOSE
THE PUBLIC.

01:42:43.420 --> 01:42:47.830
AND AGAIN, AND AS WE SAY, WE
DRIVE UP COSTS.

01:42:47.830 --> 01:42:49.660
AS MY COLLEAGUE STATED,

01:42:50.590 --> 01:42:53.170
IF WE'RE REALLY TALKING ABOUT
CONSUMERS,

01:42:53.170 --> 01:42:56.770
CONSUMERS ARE FEELING THIS AND
WE NEED TO BE

01:42:56.770 --> 01:42:59.410
MORE PRACTICAL IN WHAT WE'RE
TRYING TO DO,

01:42:59.979 --> 01:43:03.130
LEGISLATION THAT WE CAN
IMPLEMENT THAT REALLY

01:43:03.130 --> 01:43:05.620
ACHIEVES THE GOALS OF A CLEANER
ENVIRONMENT,

01:43:05.620 --> 01:43:07.900
BUT MORE IMPORTANTLY, A
RELIABILITY.

01:43:07.900 --> 01:43:09.729
AND OUR WANTS.

01:43:09.880 --> 01:43:11.260
WE WOULDN'T HAVE MADE OUR
CLIMATE

01:43:11.260 --> 01:43:12.400
GOALS TWO YEARS AGO.

01:43:12.430 --> 01:43:13.420
OUR WORLD CLIMATE GOALS

01:43:13.420 --> 01:43:14.979
IF IT WASN'T FOR NATURAL GAS.

01:43:14.979 --> 01:43:16.840
BUT NOBODY WANTS TO HAVE THAT
CONVERSATION.

01:43:17.950 --> 01:43:23.200
AND SO THAT'S MY DESIRE AS I
LEAVE THE LEGISLATURE,

01:43:23.200 --> 01:43:26.650
THAT WE HAVE POLICY MORE ROOTED
IN.

01:43:28.090 --> 01:43:31.000
I WANT TO SEE REALITY AND
IMPLEMENTATION,

01:43:31.000 --> 01:43:33.150
AND WE NEED TO HEAR FROM THE
AGENCIES,

01:43:33.150 --> 01:43:35.310
AND WE NEED TO HEAR MORE
PUSHBACK IF WE'RE MOVING IN

01:43:35.310 --> 01:43:37.080
A DIRECTION THAT MAKES IT HARDER

01:43:37.080 --> 01:43:38.130
FOR YOU TO DO YOUR JOB.

01:43:38.130 --> 01:43:39.540
SO THAT'S WHERE I AM ON THAT.

01:43:39.540 --> 01:43:42.300
SO I DON'T KNOW IF ANY MORE
COMMENTS

01:43:42.630 --> 01:43:44.640
ABOUT MY COLLEAGUE'S LAST WORD.

01:43:45.330 --> 01:43:45.780
ALL RIGHT.

01:43:45.780 --> 01:43:48.660
WELL, AGAIN, I WANT TO THANK YOU
FOR YOUR TESTIMONY.

01:43:48.660 --> 01:43:50.189
I THANK YOU FOR THE WORK THAT
YOU'RE

01:43:50.189 --> 01:43:51.360
DOING ON A DAILY BASIS.

01:43:51.390 --> 01:43:52.320
IT'S TRULY NEEDED.

01:43:52.860 --> 01:43:56.580
AND AS OUR COLLEAGUE STATED,

01:43:56.790 --> 01:43:58.410
WE'RE CREATING SOME OF THOSE
POTHOLES.

01:43:58.410 --> 01:44:00.479
AND I WANT TO BE ABLE TO HELP
YOU

01:44:00.479 --> 01:44:02.430
GUYS IMPLEMENT THIS AND MAKE IT

01:44:02.430 --> 01:44:04.500
WORK FOR ALL CALIFORNIANS AND
FOR

01:44:04.500 --> 01:44:05.550
THE ENVIRONMENT AS A WHOLE.

01:44:05.550 --> 01:44:08.160
SO, UH, FOR ANY INDIVIDUAL THAT
DIDN'T

01:44:08.160 --> 01:44:09.960
GET A CHANCE TO ADDRESS THE
COMMITTEE,

01:44:09.960 --> 01:44:12.300
WE ASK THAT YOU SUBMIT YOUR
QUESTIONS

01:44:12.300 --> 01:44:13.500
OR COMMENTS IN WRITING

01:44:13.500 --> 01:44:15.630
WOULD BE MORE THAN HAPPY TO LOOK

01:44:15.630 --> 01:44:16.770
AT THEM AND CONSIDERATION.

01:44:16.770 --> 01:44:18.870
AND I WANT TO THANK THE STAFF,
UH,

01:44:18.870 --> 01:44:20.340
AND INDIVIDUALS WHO CALLED.

01:44:20.670 --> 01:44:22.290
AND WE THANK EVERYONE FOR YOUR

01:44:22.290 --> 01:44:23.520
PATIENCE AND YOUR COOPERATION

01:44:23.520 --> 01:44:25.290
TODAY AND PARTICIPATING IN THIS
HEARING.

01:44:25.590 --> 01:44:27.090
WE'VE CONCLUDED OUR AGENDA,

